---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Footer } from '../components/Footer';
import { Navbar } from '../components/Navbar';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Online Mancala"
  description="Online Mancala privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
>
  <div class="flex flex-col min-h-screen bg-white">
    <Navbar />

    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#171717] mb-8">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>

        <div class="prose prose-lg text-[#4d4d4d] space-y-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#888888]">Last updated: July 2026</p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            Online Mancala is designed to be a lightweight, privacy-friendly gaming experience. We do not require user registration. We may collect limited usage data such as game statistics, device type, and browser information to improve the platform.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
          <p>
            We use browser local storage and session storage to save game preferences, statistics, and sound settings. These are stored locally on your device and are not transmitted to our servers.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">How We Use Information</h2>
          <p>
            Any pseudonymized game statistics collected are used solely to improve gameplay experiences and analyze feature usage. We do not sell, rent, or share personal data with third parties.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>
            We may use third-party analytics tools to understand usage patterns. These services collect anonymized usage data in accordance with their own privacy policies.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            We implement appropriate security measures to protect any data transmitted to our servers. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Children&apos;s Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Our service is suitable for users of all ages. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised last-updated date.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717]">Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact-us" class="text-[#0070f3] underline font-medium">Contact Us</a> page.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
